VERIFYING A BUILD IS GENUINE

Official releases are signed with one key. Any build that reports a different
signing certificate did not come from this project, whatever it calls itself:

  SHA-256  6d:c1:c9:16:44:76:06:b1:ce:ba:13:3e:1c:50:6f:a8:
           8e:11:25:9b:08:2c:d3:16:61:d0:c6:6c:12:42:dc:a6

  Check a file with:  apksigner verify --print-certs <apk>
